### PHP / Composer
# Composer-managed dependencies. Not tracked: composer.json + composer.lock pin
# exact versions, and build.ps1 excludes vendor/ from the staged copy and runs
# `composer install --no-dev` inside it, so the release artifact is built from
# the lock file, never from this directory.
# Restore a working tree with: composer install
/vendor/*

# EXCEPTION: pdf.js is vendored by hand, not by Composer (it is an npm package,
# not a PHP one), so nothing can regenerate it from composer.lock — build.ps1
# copies it straight out of the working tree. It must stay tracked.
!/vendor/pdfjs/

